Problem:
An engineering kids kit has two sets, a mechanical and chemistry kit. The mechanical kit requires 2 units of plastic, 4 units of materials and entertains a kid for 4 hours. The chemistry kit requires 3 units of plastic, 7 units of materials and entertains a kid for 2 hours. The chemistry kit however produces 8 units of waste while the mechanical kit produces 5 units of waste. The company has available 500 units of plastic and 450 units of materials. If the company has committed to producing at most 300 units of waste, how many of each type of kit should the company make to maximize the number of hours of entertainment?

